Kleinanzeigen AI Gaming-PC Deal Monitor

An automated n8n workflow that scans Kleinanzeigen every 15 minutes for complete gaming PCs.

Features

scans newest listings
filters complete PCs
AI detects CPU/GPU/RAM
estimates used market value
performs live web price validation
ranks every listing
sends only the best deals to Discord

Technologies

n8n
OpenRouter
GPT
DuckDuckGo
Discord Webhook

Requirements

n8n
OpenRouter API
Discord Webhook
